--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -7,3 +7,6 @@ Stores user uploads and the image variants the apps display.
 `POST /uploads` with a multipart `file` field. Each upload is validated,
 scanned, resized to three variants (large, medium, small), given three
 thumbnails (64, 128, 256 px) and stored. Returns the stored record.
+
+Add `?fast=1` to skip thumbnails and store the large variant only. Use it when
+the caller needs the upload stored quickly and never shows thumbnails.
